# Keys, the BLE pairing pin, and network profiles. All of it lives under REVERENET_HOME
# now - ~/.reverenet by default - and none of it belongs in a checkout. These stay as a
# backstop for a directory left over from before that move, or one made by hand: a key
# that has been committed is not a key any more, and a profile names a real network.
keys/
configs/
*.key
*.pin
# erase images are downloaded per board, not built here - see the README in that dir
tools/flash_erase/*.uf2
